**Title:** Whispering Waves: Kai's Gentle Journey

**Description:** In this soothing sleep story, join Kai, an eleven-year-old boy embodying quiet bravery, as he explores the tranquil coastal shoreline with his playful otter companion, Ollie. As the evening unfolds, Kai embarks on a journey of discovery—both external and internal—guided by the comforting rhythm of the ocean waves and the gentle glow of the moonlit sky. The peaceful narrative invites listeners into a world where each step reveals new wonders, fostering a sense of calm and reducing anxiety. Designed to cradle you into a restful sleep, this episode serves as a gentle reminder of the beauty in every moment and the courage found within. Let the tale of Kai and Ollie ease you into serene slumber.

